    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[This survey aims to explore individuals' eating habits, food choices, and daily nutrition. It focuses on areas such as meal frequency, fruit and vegetable intake, consumption of processed foods, hydration, and overall dietary patterns. Your responses will help us better understand how diet influences health and wellbeing and the importance of maintaining a balanced diet.]]></Value>
